                                "sense_id": "ff824fe2-e3e8-3d33-8928-57ba5cf29ae2",
                                "text": "I know many of you gaily carry on swigging rosé right through the winter, and there may be the odd day when I do, too, but I’m definitely in the mood to return to reds."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
